stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Watching
    Watching --> Checking: file changed
    Checking --> Watching: own write
    Checking --> Reloading: no unsaved changes
    Checking --> Choosing: unsaved changes
    Reloading --> Watching
    Choosing --> Reloading: Reload
    Choosing --> Watching: Keep Current
    Choosing --> Comparing: Compare
    Comparing --> Choosing
